sequenceDiagram
    participant Req1 as Request 1
    participant Req2 as Request 2
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant Lock as Redis Lock
    participant DB as Database

    Req1->>Cache: Get data
    Req2->>Cache: Get data
    Cache->>Req1: Cache miss
    Cache->>Req2: Cache miss
    Req1->>Lock: Acquire lock "rebuild:key"
    Lock->>Req1: Lock acquired
    Req2->>Lock: Acquire lock "rebuild:key"
    Lock->>Req2: Lock failed
    Req1->>DB: Query database
    Req2->>Req2: Wait with exponential backoff
    DB->>Req1: Return data
    Req1->>Cache: Store in cache
    Req1->>Lock: Release lock
    Req2->>Cache: Try cache again
    Cache->>Req2: Return cached data